{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Chocky 是一款可離線運作的 AI 助理，適合經常身處無網絡環境、重視隨身問答與近距離通訊的 iPhone 及 iPad 用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-211.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線問答與藍牙通訊</h2>\n<p>用戶可透過語音或文字提問，即使在飛機模式或網絡中斷時，仍能取得離線百科與裝置內急救指南的答案；說出「Chocky」即可免持聆聽回覆。附近用戶可經藍牙傳送文字、相片與語音，毋須互聯網或電話號碼，訊息具端對端加密。另可下載免費參考包、加入 PDF，並以鏡頭取得動植物辨識建議。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-81-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-82-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-83-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-84-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1290x2796bb-85-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Chocky: Offline AI Assistant</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/chocky-offline-ai-assistant/id6829019066?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T00:42:54.213861+00:00","quality"